            "description": "<p id=\"date\">2026年8月7日</p>\n<p class=\"info\">\t\n</p>\n    <h1 id=\"article-title\" class=\"sub_ex_article-title\">恒指跌385點 失守牛熊線<br>    \n   \n    </h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://static.hkej.com/hkej/images/2026/08/07/4477717_b4478d05d057ab8cc54e580c445c77c0.png\" title=\"\" class=\"thickbox\"><img src=\"https://static.hkej.com/hkej/images/2026/08/07/4477717_b4478d05d057ab8cc54e580c445c77c0_620.png\" border=\"0\"></a></p>\n<span class='enlargeImg'><a href=\"https://static.hkej.com/hkej/images/2026/08/07/4477717_b4478d05d057ab8cc54e580c445c77c0.png\" title=\"\" class=\"thickbox\"><img src='https://static.hkej.com/hkej/ejweb/enlarge.gif' align='absmiddle' />放大圖片</a> / <a href=\"https://static.hkej.com/hkej/images/2026/08/07/4477717_b4478d05d057ab8cc54e580c445c77c0.png\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"\">顯示原圖</a></span>\n<p></p>\n亞洲區科技股再現跌勢，南韓KOSPI指數熔斷利淡氣氛，加上港股受內地對境外保險收益徵稅傳聞困擾，大市昨回吐近400點。恒指一舉失守10天線（25634點）及250天牛熊線（25729點），年初至今升幅再度全數蒸發。\n恒指昨低開近250點已是全日高位，早段最多瀉526點，低見25389點。大市之後低位...\n<p>（節錄）</p>",
